 outlast the shame Oh Algeria been blackness"},{"s":78.36,"e":81.68,"text":"blazing here The maddened world is drowning deep"},{"s":81.68,"e":84.32,"text":"in fear Actual living God through breath and"},{"s":84.32,"e":86.8,"text":"flame Through life and death we call your"},{"s":86.8,"e":89.56,"text":"sacred name All forms of good all forces"},{"s":89.56,"e":92.3,"text":"formed for peace Come calm the storm and"},{"s":92.3,"e":95.38,"text":"make the madness cease Let justice join with"},{"s":95.38,"e":98.64,"text":"mercy hand in hand Make us the answer"},{"s":98.9,"e":103.02,"text":"teach us how to stand Let harmony begin"},{"s":103.02,"e":107.44,"text":"within begin Let harmony begin beneath the skin"},{"s":107.36,"e":111.14,"text":"Let harmony begin where hate has been outgined"},{"s":111.14,"e":114.26,"text":"in Let harmony begin City split siren slice"},{"s":114.26,"e":116.74,"text":"the sheets of rain While children dream through"},{"s":116.74,"e":119.78,"text":"thunder dust and pain Let rifles rust let"},{"s":119.78,"e":122.52,"text":"rockets rot to red Let bread be broken"},{"s":122.52,"e":125.38,"text":"where the blood was shed Let greed release"},{"s":125.38,"e":127.48,"text":"its grip on grain and gold Let warm"},{"s":127.48,"e":130,"text":"hands hold the hungry from the cold Let"},{"s":130,"e":133,"text":"conscience catch the hand before the blade Let"},{"s":133,"e":135.7,"text":"kindness crown the choices we have made Let"},{"s":135.7,"e":138.92,"text":"justice judge let mercy mend the scar For"},{"s":138.92,"e":141.9,"text":"peace is more than silence after war Let"},{"s":141.9,"e":145.42,"text":"truth confront the cruel without revenge Then let"},{"s":145.42,"e":149.52,"text":"forgiveness flourish at the edge Quantum choirs that"},{"s":149.52,"e":152.34,"text":"quiver under form Converge with care and calm"},{"s":152.26,"e":155.42,"text":"each calming storm To starless seas where sleeping"},{"s":155.42,"e":158.84,"text":"signals spin Send sacred stillness through the static"},{"s":158.84,"e":161.66,"text":"din To minds that shine where mortal sight"},{"s":161.66,"e":165.2,"text":"grows dim To living structures stationed past the"},{"s":165.2,"e":167.98,"text":"rim Come only bearing mercy truth and grace"},{"s":167.98,"e":172.62,"text":"Bring no dominion near the human race Actual"},{"s":172.62,"e":175.62,"text":"living God beyond all form Bring peace to"},{"s":175.62,"e":178.58,"text":"us transform the human storm Do not descend"},{"s":178.58,"e":181.56,"text":"with terror sword or rod Make love our"},{"s":181.56,"e":184.62,"text":"proof that we have heard from God Who"},{"s":184.62,"e":188.74,"text":"heals the hurt The heart beyond the night"},{"s":188.74,"e":192.58,"text":"Who heals the hate The hands that harbor"},{"s":192.5,"e":198.78,"text":"light Who brings the peace The people made"},{"s":198.78,"e":205.96,"text":"aware Then make us brave enough to be"},{"s":205.96,"e":211.74,"text":"the prey Archetype of mercy move amend Let"},{"s":211.74,"e":214.68,"text":"separated selves see self as friend Form of"},{"s":214.68,"e":217.74,"text":"forgiveness float through field and frame Let each"},{"s":217.74,"e":220.78,"text":"face shine with one shared sacred flame Atom"},{"s":220.78,"e":223.38,"text":"of patience pulse through pride and pain Turn"},{"s":223.38,"e":227.4,"text":"fevered fury into fertile rain Spirit of stillness"},{"s":227.78,"e":230.34,"text":"settle all the din And let the living"},{"s":230.34,"e":234.34,"text":"harmony begin No distant star can do what"},{"s":234.34,"e":237.48,"text":"we refuse No sacred spark can choose what"},{"s":237.48,"e":240.4,"text":"humans choose So move our feet and fortify"},{"s":240.4,"e":243.82,"text":"our hands Make peace a practice spreading through"},{"s":243.82,"e":250.16,"text":"the land So archetype and blackness blazing here"},{"s":250.16,"e":253.02,"text":"The maddened world is drowning deep in fear"},{"s":253.02,"e":256.02,"text":"Actual living God through br